    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cYou're not alone here. You've never been alone.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/81baf80ea42a259969f5843f5ce5dfbf.avif?t=1748453147\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once cozy mansion on the edge of town becomes the epicenter of a nightmare. 70-year-old Olivia Sanders is found brutally murdered, and her caregiver, Clara Turner, disappears without a trace. Suspicion falls on her, and the investigation quickly unfolds - but the involvement of the victim's grandson, Detective Ethan Sanders, is flatly refused to be reckoned with. He is removed from the case, forced to take a vacation.... But grief, anxiety and inner voice push Ethan to the only decision - to take the investigation into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.poster.avif?t=1748453147\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.webm?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.mp4?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, he breaks into his grandmother's sealed house. But instead of answers, something very different awaits him. The house takes on a life of its own. Walls shift, corridors loop, time breaks. Memories, fears, nightmares - everything comes to life, turning a personal investigation into a brutal trial on the brink of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.poster.avif?t=1748453147\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.webm?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.mp4?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/6600331141a4b9bc48cc8dea4c98f518.avif?t=1748453147\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Photo-realistic graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Realistic gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. High-quality audio accompaniment, creating an atmosphere of maximum fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Unpredictable gameplay: the house will change as the game progresses, creating new obstacles and puzzles for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Explore the tragedy of the Sanders family and uncover the secrets hidden behind closed doors</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cYou're not alone here. You've never been alone.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/81baf80ea42a259969f5843f5ce5dfbf.avif?t=1748453147\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once cozy mansion on the edge of town becomes the epicenter of a nightmare. 70-year-old Olivia Sanders is found brutally murdered, and her caregiver, Clara Turner, disappears without a trace. Suspicion falls on her, and the investigation quickly unfolds - but the involvement of the victim's grandson, Detective Ethan Sanders, is flatly refused to be reckoned with. He is removed from the case, forced to take a vacation.... But grief, anxiety and inner voice push Ethan to the only decision - to take the investigation into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.poster.avif?t=1748453147\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.webm?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/60e0221fbe407fe545bb94a7d9233109.mp4?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, he breaks into his grandmother's sealed house. But instead of answers, something very different awaits him. The house takes on a life of its own. Walls shift, corridors loop, time breaks. Memories, fears, nightmares - everything comes to life, turning a personal investigation into a brutal trial on the brink of madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.poster.avif?t=1748453147\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.webm?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/ed2295aea2e01ef9ee3800ce272403b4.mp4?t=1748453147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751490/extras/6600331141a4b9bc48cc8dea4c98f518.avif?t=1748453147\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Photo-realistic graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Realistic gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. High-quality audio accompaniment, creating an atmosphere of maximum fear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Unpredictable gameplay: the house will change as the game progresses, creating new obstacles and puzzles for the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Explore the tragedy of the Sanders family and uncover the secrets hidden behind closed doors</p>",
    "short_description": "Investigating the mysterious death of his grandmother, a detective breaks into her home to discover the truth, but the dwelling begins to play tricks on him. The space breaks, fears become flesh, and there is still no way out. Every step, every new room, every cycle is a chance to go mad.",
